  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Associated skill 5 ranks, Navigation sphere (Resilience Training).</p>\n<p>You may select the following acclimations benefits:</p>\n<p><strong>Indefatigable:</strong> Acclimated targets ignore the penalties to Strength and Dexterity from the fatigued condition and treat themselves as fatigued whenever they would become exhausted. If you have at least 15 ranks in one of your associated skills, acclimated targets also become immune to the fatigued and exhausted conditions.</p>\n<p><strong>Unstoppable Trekker:</strong> Acclimated targets are immune to falling damage, cave-in damage, pressure damage, damage from the fire-dominant planar trait, and other damaging environmental effects.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/navigation#toc61\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
